    <sys:String x:Key="Dialog.About.Title">About DK2 Ultimate Editor</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Dialog.About.Text">Dungeon Keeper 2 Ultimate Editor (UltimateEditor). A modern C# / WPF rewrite of NovFR's map editor, with English and Russian interfaces, map and scenario editing, and a local MCP bridge. Original editor: NovFR. Enhancements, ongoing development and new features: Quuz and contributors. Flame author and ongoing development collaborator: DiaLight. Full feature parity and in-game acceptance are still in progress.

Project: https://github.com/Quuz/Dk2UltimateEditor</sys:String>
